:: Statement-only formalization of Logipedia corpus artifact connectives.conj
:: (logipedia__mizar__connectives.conj), the conjunction-introduction rule for
:: arbitrary propositions. This file contains no proof.

environ

begin

::$P-
scheme Conj { A[], B[] }:
  A[] implies (B[] implies A[] & B[])
proof
end;
::$P+
